---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { resolvePath } from '../../lib/paths';
import '../../styles/project.css';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Proposal · Project"
  description="Project proposal for implementing computational models for aircraft lightning zoning."
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 pt-16 pb-24">

    <!-- ===== Navigation Breadcrumb ===== -->
    <nav class="mb-10" aria-label="Breadcrumb" data-reveal="1">
      <a
        href={resolvePath('/project')}
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-solar hover:text-solar-light transition-colors"
        style="border-bottom:none;"
      >
        <span aria-hidden="true">←</span> Back to Project Timeline
      </a>
    </nav>

    <!-- ===== Header ===== -->
    <header class="project-detail-header" data-reveal="1">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-display font-bold leading-[1.25] pb-3 mb-2">
        Project Proposal
      </h1>

      <p class="text-solar-light text-xl font-sans font-light max-w-3xl leading-relaxed mb-3">
        Implementing Computational Models for Aircraft Lightning Zoning
      </p>

      <time class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-void-400 block">
        September 2026
      </time>
    </header>

    <!-- ===== Content Sections ===== -->
    <article class="space-y-12 mt-10" data-reveal="2">

      <!-- =========================================================================
           Section 1: The Problem
           ========================================================================= -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-display font-bold text-void-100 mb-4">
          1. The Problem
        </h2>

        <p class="text-void-200 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-4">
          <strong>There is a need for computationally efficient simulation tools for aircraft lightning strikes.</strong>
          Physical models for aircraft-lightning interactions are established in a small body of literature,
          but implementation of these models has been limited. It is not clear if existing literature
          contains sufficient information to repeatably implement these models.
        </p>

        <p class="text-void-200 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-0">
          The MIT Aerospace Plasma Group has an implementation of these models written using Taichi Lang,
          but this may not be the optimal framework. Simulations are highly parallelizable and rely on
          GPU offloading, quantized datatypes, and other complex tools. <strong>Implementing robust, extensible,
          and efficient simulations is a pressing research challenge.</strong>
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- =========================================================================
           Section 2: Why It Matters
           ========================================================================= -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-display font-bold text-void-100 mb-4">
          2. Why It Matters
        </h2>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 my-2">
          <div class="border border-solar/20 bg-void-950/70 p-5">
            <span class="font-mono text-xs text-solar block mb-2">RESEARCH IMPACT</span>
            <p class="text-void-200 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-0">
              Efficiently implementing the models will accelerate academic research into the dynamics
              of aircraft-lightning interactions, and enable more rapid industry adoption of
              physics-based analysis tools.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="border border-solar/20 bg-void-950/70 p-5">
            <span class="font-mono text-xs text-solar block mb-2">LITERATURE GAPS</span>
            <p class="text-void-200 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-0">
              The project will identify gaps in the literature by demonstrating whether it is possible
              to build a functioning toolkit from published information alone. Understanding what
              additional information needs to be published will be of significant industry value.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- =========================================================================
           Section 3: What the Agent Will Do
           ========================================================================= -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-display font-bold text-void-100 mb-4">
          3. What the Agent Will Do
        </h2>

        <p class="text-void-200 text-base leading-relaxed mb-6">
          The agent will plan and execute the implementation, from scratch and without bias from the
          existing codebase, of a lightning zoning toolkit. Milestones and ambitious stretch goals:
        </p>

        <!-- Milestone table -->
        <div class="border border-solar/20 bg-void-950 divide-y divide-solar/15 my-2">

          <div class="p-4 flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between sm:items-start gap-2">
            <div>
              <span class="font-mono text-xs text-solar block mb-1">MILESTONE 1</span>
              <span class="font-sans font-semibold text-void-100">Plan toolkit architecture &amp; select frameworks</span>
              <p class="text-void-400 text-sm mt-1 mb-0 font-sans">
                Based on literature, user requirements, and example input files.
              </p>
            </div>
            <span class="font-mono text-xs text-solar uppercase font-semibold shrink-0">Core</span>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between sm:items-start gap-2 bg-solar/5">
            <div>
              <span class="font-mono text-xs text-solar-light block mb-1">MILESTONE 2</span>
              <span class="font-sans font-semibold text-white">Implement lightning simulation architecture &amp; algorithms</span>
              <p class="text-void-400 text-sm mt-1 mb-0 font-sans">
                Including efficient, parallel algorithms for the physics models. <strong class="text-void-300">Main task.</strong>
              </p>
            </div>
            <span class="font-mono text-xs text-solar uppercase font-semibold shrink-0">Core</span>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between sm:items-start gap-2">
            <div>
              <span class="font-mono text-xs text-void-400 block mb-1">STRETCH GOAL A</span>
              <span class="font-sans font-semibold text-void-300">Implement an efficient Laplace solver</span>
              <p class="text-void-500 text-sm mt-1 mb-0 font-sans">Build it into the toolkit.</p>
            </div>
            <span class="font-mono text-xs text-void-500 uppercase shrink-0">Stretch</span>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between sm:items-start gap-2">
            <div>
              <span class="font-mono text-xs text-void-400 block mb-1">STRETCH GOAL B</span>
              <span class="font-sans font-semibold text-void-300">Implement an efficient Euler solver (or connect to SU2)</span>
              <p class="text-void-500 text-sm mt-1 mb-0 font-sans">Build it into the toolkit.</p>
            </div>
            <span class="font-mono text-xs text-void-500 uppercase shrink-0">Stretch</span>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between sm:items-start gap-2">
            <div>
              <span class="font-mono text-xs text-void-400 block mb-1">STRETCH GOAL C</span>
              <span class="font-sans font-semibold text-void-300">Automated mesh generation tool</span>
              <p class="text-void-500 text-sm mt-1 mb-0 font-sans">Complete the end-to-end toolkit.</p>
            </div>
            <span class="font-mono text-xs text-void-500 uppercase shrink-0">Stretch</span>
          </div>

        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- =========================================================================
           Section 4: Data & Restrictions
           ========================================================================= -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-display font-bold text-void-100 mb-4">
          4. Data &amp; Restrictions
        </h2>

        <ul class="list-none space-y-3 pl-0 my-2 text-void-200">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-solar font-mono text-sm shrink-0">◆</span>
            <span>AI agents will not have access to any sensitive data; only <strong>open-source geometries</strong> will be used to test the toolkit.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-solar font-mono text-sm shrink-0">◆</span>
            <span>One <strong>pre-publication journal paper</strong> may be given in the reference literature.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

    </article>

    <!-- ===== Navigation to Previous / Next Milestones ===== -->
    <div class="mt-16 pt-8 border-t border-solar/20" data-reveal="4">
      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <a href={resolvePath('/project/background')} class="project-nav-adjacent">
          <span class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-solar">Previous Milestone // 01</span>
          <span class="font-sans font-medium text-solar-light mt-1">← Project Background</span>
        </a>

        <a href={resolvePath('/project')} class="project-nav-adjacent text-right">
          <span class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-void-400">Timeline</span>
          <span class="font-sans font-medium text-void-200 mt-1">All Milestones Overview →</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</BaseLayout>
